{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けやき坂46の井口眞緒です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH3W45RGY6BENBVGFH1TNQZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の富士急ロケ見てくれましたかー？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とーーーっても楽しくてもう前日から興奮しまくりの私でした。（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶叫マシーンやお化け屋敷が大好きではあもうほーんとに楽しすぎました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH3W55BEQ5FHYYD192GA6KX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"収録の始まる前からすでに苦痛そうなきょんこ。そして、いつもに増して楽しそうな私。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああもうすごく楽しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お化け屋敷で泣いて抱きついてくるあやが可愛すぎましたー！\nきっとあんなことをされたら、みんなあやを好きになっちゃうと思います。\n私みたいな謎に強気な変な彼女はモテないのかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お化け怖いけどこわくないんです！楽しいんです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また行きたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジェットコースターもこわいけど、楽しくて怖さが大好きなんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変わってるのかな。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怖がらない私は、女の子としては可愛げがないなと思っています。（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもまた行きたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで読んでくれてありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いぐちまお"}],"source":"archive"}